    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "PI 控制增大了转折频率以下的频率响应幅值以减小稳态误差，但会引入相位滞后，必须使该滞后保持在较低水平以避免降低稳定性。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "PI control increases frequency-response magnitude at frequencies below the break point, decreasing steady-state errors, but contributes phase lag that must be kept low to avoid degrading stability.",
